					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drchandra" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1956625); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1956625&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605883869" alt="DrChandra" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1956625)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drchandra" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1956625); return false;" >DrChandra</a></span> <span class="odate time_1529647333 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">22 Jun 2018 06:02</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3845703">
									

<p>So as most of you know, I write Dread &amp; Circuses, and I normally portray the Circus as a sanctuary for Anomalous Humanoids. Here I wanted to try something different: write an Anomalous Humanoid who's happy he escaped the Circus and ended up in containment.</p>
<p>Anyway, with this SCP I have now achieved my arbitrary goal of having an SCP in every century of series IV. Series V really kind of snuck up on us didn't it?</p>
<p>As usual, thanks to my Beta Readers; Zyn, Lazar, stormbreath, V-something, Floppy Phoenix, Dog Teeth, among others.</p>
<p>P.S. It's intentionally ambiguous whether the Clown with Manny is Icky or Lolly. Whichever you prefer is fine.</p>

