														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3845708">
									

<p>This is great, Chandra! Nitpick:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>I smashed a vase, just to use its fragments as a weapon, and it unleashed dozens of ancient spirits who started tearing up the place.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>This just feels clunky and unnatural to me. Try:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>I smashed a vase, and ghosts or something blasted out of it. While they were tearing up the place&#8230;</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Overall, pretty good article! I tend to enjoy these simple anomalies, because it really solidifies the Foundationverse. Not everything needs to have a sinister purpose to it.</p>

							</div>

								
